Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:05:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第16集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.29,0:00:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴就要来了 而你们两个 你们就摇逸在风暴的中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm's coming and you boys, you are smack in the middle of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸想让我们继承他的事业 救助他人 猎杀魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off. Saving people, hunting things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 家族事业 - 我希望尽我们所能去拯救更多的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The family business. - We gotta save as many people as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你和我都看到过… 大多数人想象不到的魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you and I have seen things most people couldn't even dream about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是超自然的东西 我们就杀了它们 这就是我们的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's supernatural we kill it. That's our job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 迪恩 这不是我们的工作 我们要做的是猎杀恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean, that is not our job. Our job is hunting evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都一样 萨姆 他们不是人类 懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're all the same, Sam. They're not human, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须把他们每一个都杀光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to exterminate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的生活就是怪诞奇异的 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our lives are weird, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还用你说吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们迷路了 - 不 这是条捷径{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're lost. - No, this is a shortcut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 只是我们在这条路上 已经开了一个多小时了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, it's just we've been on this road over an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们连一辆车的影子都没看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't seen a single car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 我懂怎么看这该死的地图 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, I know how to read a frigging map, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我们路过了一个加油站 还是找个人问下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We passed that gas station. Let's just go ask someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.03,0:01:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是40分钟之前的事了 我们可不要再转回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was 40 minutes ago. We're not turning around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 这样的争论是不是有点老土了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Isn't this argument a little archaic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在的时代男人是可以问路的 - 哦 不 不能 我们不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Men can ask directions these days. - Oh, no, no, we can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和我的基因相反 你瞧 我知道我们具体在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's against our genetic code. Look, I know exactly where we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是吗？在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,99号公路 好吗？直接就能穿过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highway 99, okay? It cuts right through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,99号公路？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highway 99?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走的是观光路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so we're taking the scenic route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是我们的周年纪念 我们却不得不呆在这车里度过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our anniversary and we're spending it stuck in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我补偿你一下 好吗？来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let me make it up to you, okay? Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 我生你气了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Stop. I'm mad at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.53,0:02:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不爱 你是个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't. You're a jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.12,0:02:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大卫 我是说真的 - 莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- David, I mean it. - Ha, ha-Molly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事 我真的很抱歉 我没看到你在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. I'm so sorry. I didn't see you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 你受伤了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you? Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好好 冷静点 冷静点 告诉我们发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, calm down. Calm down. Tell us what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我突然转向 然后发生了车祸 当我清醒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swerved and we crashed. And when I came to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,车已经报废了 我的丈夫也不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, the car was wrecked. My husband was missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我四处寻找他 不过那个在公路上的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went looking for him but that's when the man from the road…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他… 他开始追我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he started chasing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的头发和胡须是不是看起来像割草机修过一样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he look like he lost a fight with a lawnmower?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰大运而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 你叫什么名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, what's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 莫莉·麦克纳摩拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly. Molly McNamara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也许你应该跟我们一起走 我们把你送到镇上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should come with us. We'll take you back into town-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能 我要去找大卫 他可能已经回车里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I have to find David. He might've gone back to the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们首先得把你送到一个安全的地方 然后迪恩和我会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get you somewhere safe. Dean and I will come back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找你的丈夫的 - 不 我不能丢下他一个人离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll look for your husband. - No. I'm not leaving here without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.47,0:06:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以陪我回我车那里吗 求你了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you just take me back to my car, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定车就是在这儿 我… 我们撞到那棵树 就在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure this is where it was. We hit that tree right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这… 这没有道理啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们得离开这里 葛瑞利可能在任何时候出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of here. Greeley could show up at any second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要怎么告诉她？- 真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What're you gonna tell her? - The truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.23,0:07:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会吓的朝另外一个方向跑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna take off running in the other direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来有点疯狂 不过我的确是撞到那棵树了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it sounds crazy, but I crashed into that tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道谁能把车搬走了 车已经撞报废了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who could've taken it. It was totaled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你们了 你们得相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you have to believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 听着 我们的确相信你 这就是为什么我们得带你离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we do believe you, all right? That's why we wanna get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫怎么办？肯定有什么事发生了 我得去报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about David? Something must have happened. I have to get to the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,报警 这是个很棒的主意 我们会亲自把你送到警察局 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops. That's a great idea. We'll take you down to the station ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就… 就跟我们走吧 这是我们能帮你和你丈夫的最好方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just come with us. It's the best way we can help you and your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.61,0:08:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在本应该是到了太浩湖的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to be in Lake Tahoe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天是我们5周年结婚纪念 - 糟透了的周年纪念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's our five-year anniversary. - A hell of an anniversary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在刚刚之前 我们在冷战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right before, we were having the dumbest fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是仅有的一次真正的争吵 当我们困在车里的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only time we ever argue, when we're stuck in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道发生什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know how that goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最后对他说的话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the last thing I said to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说他是个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called him a jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这… 如果这成为我对他所说的最后一句话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if that's the last thing I said to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会弄清楚你丈夫到底发生了什么事 我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna figure out what happened to your husband. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你？- 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心过你这样回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I was afraid you'd say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.83,0:09:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This song…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么？- 发生车祸的时候也在播这歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It was playing when we crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.85,0:09:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的 她是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mine. She's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.73,0:09:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.87,0:09:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚刚到底发生了什么事？- 别担心 莫莉 一切都会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell just happened? - Don't worry, Molly. Everything's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说的有点太早了 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you spoke a little too soon, Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他是不会让她离开的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's gonna let her leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事是不可能发生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 的确发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}trust me, it's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 谢谢你们的帮助 我想从这里开始我自己就可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okay, thanks for helping, but I think I got it covered from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 莫莉 莫莉 等一下 - 别跟着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, Molly, wait a minute. - Just leave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 求你了 你得听我说 - 别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. You have to listen to me. - Just stay away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们碰上你并不是一个巧合 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a coincidence that we found you, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们刚刚碰上你的时候… 我们并不是在载着美眉兜风… 姐妹儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't cruising for chicks when we ran into you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来就是跑到这里来猎捕的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were already out here. Hunting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎捕什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.59,0:11:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别… 应该委婉的告诉她 - 你们是疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't sugarcoat it for her. - You're nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？就和那个内脏像粉一样 灰飞烟灭的家伙一样疯吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? About as nuts as a vanishing guy with his guts spilling out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚你看到了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为他的名字叫约拿格雷利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think his name is Jonah Greeley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是15年前死在这条路上的当地农民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a local farmer that died 15 years ago on this highway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别… 说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一年 在他死忌的晚上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night a year, on the anniversary of his death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.79,0:11:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会在这条路上出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he haunts this road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们在这里的原因 莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're here, Molly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:12:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,要试着阻止他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to try and stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我猜也是这只鬼把我的车弄消失的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I suppose this ghost made my car disappear too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.47,0:12:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的事情发生了 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazier things have happened, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我都已经快疯掉了 我要自己去报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm all filled up on crazy. I'm gonna get the cops myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想把话说的太直 但是我想你不会跑出去太远的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to be harsh, but I don't think you're gonna get too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.65,0:12:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是说原本计划就是带你离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means that plan A was trying to get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然计划因为… 农民公路杀手而进行的不太顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, that didn't go over too well with, uh, Farmer Roadkill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 我们说的是事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, we're telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷利是不会让你离开这条公路的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greeley's not gonna let you leave this highway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious about this, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every year, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷利都要找某人… 为了曾经发生在他身上的事情而进行惩罚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greeley finds someone to punish for what happened to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚那个人就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, that person is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.39,0:12:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是我？我什么都没有做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me? I didn't do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这没有关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某些鬼魂眼中 他们只能看到他们想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some spirits only see what they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你们说的这个格雷利 他带走了我的丈夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying this Greeley, he took my husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 你瞧 我们会帮忙的 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, look, we're gonna help, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先 你要帮助我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, you gotta help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助你们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么帮？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里 这就是我看到他的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. This is where I saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是他的猎捕小屋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've been his hunting cabin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来真是个讨人喜欢的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seemed like a real sweet guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.41,0:13:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外面没有墓碑或者墓石 - 你在找格雷利的坟墓？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No markers or headstones outside. - You're looking for Greeley's grave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就可以把他的尸体挖出来 撒上盐并且烧掉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can dig up the corpse and salt and burn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 当然了 本来就该这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure. Naturally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是除掉鬼魂的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a way to get rid of a spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样会救大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that'll save David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是可以帮助你们二人的方法 如果可以找到尸体的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is what'll help both of you. Provided there's a corpse to be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.59,0:14:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们如何才能找到尸体？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we find it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 说不好 格雷利死后 他的妻子领回了尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure. After Greeley died, his wife claimed the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是其他人最后一次看见她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last anyone saw of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以好的可能性是她把他带回到这里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good guess she brought him back here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们有几千英亩的地 他可能被埋在任何地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they had a thousand acres. He could be buried anywhere on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就是干这个的？你们就像是捉鬼赶死队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is really what you guys do. You're like Ghostbusters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 除了他们那套制服以外 这真的是场很投机的谈话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, minus the jumpsuits. Look, this is a fascinating conversation and all…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这条公路每年只闹一次鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this highway's only haunted once a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在日出之前把他搞定 你说怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got till sunup to wrap this thing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续 好吗？太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we move it along? Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在找什么？- 格雷利的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we looking for? - Greeley's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他被埋在那里 找一条路或者小道什么的 跟紧点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's buried there. Look for roads or paths or something. Stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.55,0:14:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 帮帮我 莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me. Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？大卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David? David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个婊子养的到底对我丈夫做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has that son of a bitch done with my husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 好吗？你会再见到大卫的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy, all right? You're gonna see David again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会的 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You will. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.35,0:15:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着阴森的砖头路走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the creepy brick road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西是射击盐块的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing shoots rock salt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.37,0:16:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,用盐可以防范鬼魂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And plain salt keeps away spirits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单的总是最好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple remedies are always the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大多数文化中 盐象征纯洁 所以可以抵御邪恶和肮脏的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most cultures, saIt's a symbol of purity so it repels impure and unnatural things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就和你把他们从肩膀上扔出去是一个道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same reason you throw it over your shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 只有这次 我喜欢眼前突然… 看见一座漂亮的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just once I'd like to round the corner and see a nice house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有墓碑吗？是的 没错 有过这么容易的事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any headstones outside? Yeah, right. Is it ever that easy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个检查楼上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two check upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能找到什么笔记或者记录…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can find notes or records where he's buried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我检查楼下 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll just check down here. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.17,0:18:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是格雷利和他的妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Greeley and his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他给她写的一封情书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a love letter he wrote her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊 这写的太美了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, it's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白这样的一个人… 是如何变成那样的怪物的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand how a guy like this can turn into that monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,像格雷利这样的鬼魂像是 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}spirits like Greeley are, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是受伤的动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like wounded animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,承受经历了太多的痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In so much pain that they lash out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？为什么他们在这儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why are they here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的一些… 把他们留在了这里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's some part of them that's keeping them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.15,0:19:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他们残留的 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like their remains, or, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,未完成的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}unfinished business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.95,0:19:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,未完成的事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unfinished business"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是复仇 可能是爱情 或者是憎恨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be revenge. It could be love or hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是什么原因 都把他们缠的太紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, they just hold on too tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.05,0:19:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们就被套牢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they're trapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此的循环下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught in the same loops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不断的重复着惨剧 反反复复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Replaying the same tragedies over and over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来你为他们感到遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound almost sorry for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是邪恶的人 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they weren't evil people. You know, the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们中的许多都曾是很好的人 只不过…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of them were good. Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些事情发生在他们身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些他们无法控制的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something they couldn't control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当像这样的事情发生的时候… 萨姆也像珍妮弗洛夫休伊特一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's getting a little J. Love Hewitt when it comes to things like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.83,0:20:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 跟他们不一样 我绝对不会为他们做任何道歉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I don't like them and I sure as hell aingt making apologies for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼下没什么东西 你们找到什么了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing downstairs. You find anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.84,0:20:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是他们曾经所有的信或者是字条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just about every piece of mail or receipt they ever had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.30,0:20:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了一对夫妻的过去 但是目前还没有关于墓地的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked through a couple, but nothing about a grave so far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 这后面有什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - There's something behind here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.23,0:20:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.83,0:20:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从里面锁上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked from the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.48,0:21:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来像是有个老女人在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like old lady in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.29,0:21:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就解释清楚为什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that would explain why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们知道为什么 没有人再次见到她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now we know why nobody ever saw her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想失去他后继续活下去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't wanna live without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.09,0:21:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 来帮把手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, give me a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:21:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不能就这样留下她 - 为什么不？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't leave her like this. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她应该得到安息 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She deserves to be put to rest, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.16,0:22:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.04,0:22:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 如果你们也让格雷利得到安息的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you manage to put Greeley to rest too…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.59,0:22:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happens to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.63,0:22:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 这样的答案可远超出我们的工资等级了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, that answer is way beyond our pay grade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们猎捕这些东西 但是你却不知道他们会怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hunt these things but you don't know what happens to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们永远不会再回来了 这才是重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never come back. That's all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.61,0:22:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们放下了无论是什么 束缚他们留下的东西 他们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After they let go of whatever is keeping them here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.94,0:22:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望是某处更好的地方 但是我们不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope someplace better, but we don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.03,0:22:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你们烧掉他们的尸骨后会怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when you burn their bones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸曾经说… 对于灵魂那就像是死亡的意思 你明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my dad used to say that it was like death for ghosts, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 事实是 我们还是不知道 不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the truth is, we still don't know, not for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这就是为什么我们 都如此的渴望生命的继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's why we all hold onto life so hard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.64,0:23:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是死去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.64,0:23:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都只是害怕未知的事物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all just scared of the unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一害怕的事情就是失去大卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I'm scared of is losing David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.23,0:23:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要再次见到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to see him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.20,0:23:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.07,0:24:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我们应该告诉关于他丈夫的事情 - 我们不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should tell her about her husband. - We can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.87,0:24:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 让她为了他而悲伤憔悴 这是很残忍的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's cruel, letting her pine for him like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.16,0:24:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想让她蒙在鼓里 - 这是为了她好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't like keeping her in the dark. - It's for her own good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.88,0:24:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我知道你很内疚 但我们得按计划行事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you feel guilty, but let's just stick to the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.67,0:24:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们先把她带出去 然后再告诉她 - 告诉我什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get her out of here, then we'll tell. - Tell me what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.93,0:24:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有什么事没告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What aren't you telling me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.10,0:24:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是关于大卫的 你们知道他发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about David. You know what happened to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.02,0:24:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫莉… - 萨姆 别…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Molly. - Sam, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.27,0:24:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.77,0:24:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不告诉我因为我会 打乱了你们的猎捕计划？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me because I'll mess up your hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.15,0:24:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们不关心我或者我的丈夫 - 这不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't care about me or my husband. - That's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:24:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么无论是什么 告诉我 求你们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then whatever it is, tell me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.38,0:25:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.09,0:25:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在她身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.71,0:25:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.66,0:26:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他抓走了莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! He's got Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.10,0:26:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙真固执{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy is persistent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.48,0:26:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须找到莫莉 - 我们要找到格雷利的尸骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta find Molly. - We gotta find Greeley's bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.06,0:26:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 呃… 不要有压力或者其他的什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, no pressure or anything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.90,0:26:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但日出离我们只有不到2小时了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we got less than two hours before sunrise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.28,0:26:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:26:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.95,0:27:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,1992年2月6号 这是好象是事故发生前的两个星期 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, "February 6, 1992." That was like two weeks before the accident, wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.41,0:27:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这看上去像是狩猎的小屋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I mean, it looks like the hunting cabin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.66,0:27:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 我确信就在他们站的位置旁边 应该有一棵树才对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I swear there's a tree there right where they're standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.46,0:27:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早应该想到了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should've thought of it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.76,0:27:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个古老的乡村习俗 迪恩 种一棵树来做为坟墓的标记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an old country custom, Dean. Planting a tree as a grave marker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.93,0:27:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真像是本活的怪诞百科全书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a walking encyclopedia of weirdness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.27,0:27:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.90,0:27:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫在哪儿？你对他做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's David? What did you do to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该再为他担心什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't worry about him anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.24,0:27:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.49,0:27:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该为自己担心一下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should worry about yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.24,0:27:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从来没有对你做过任何事 - 哦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't do anything to you. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.96,0:27:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 我知道你妻子的事 伤害我也换不回她的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I know about your wife. Hurting me won't bring her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.17,0:27:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.88,0:28:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有留给我所要做的事就是伤害你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I got left's hurting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.23,0:28:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,求… 求求你了 就放我走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please, just let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.94,0:28:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放你走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.44,0:28:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走不了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.36,0:28:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都走不了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.75,0:28:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,去救莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.10,0:28:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.56,0:28:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, call me Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.94,0:29:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙真的把我惹恼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's really pissing me off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.00,0:29:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.20,0:30:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 亲爱的 今晚可真难熬啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby, it's been a long night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.45,0:30:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.54,0:30:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们带你离开这里吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.58,0:30:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们告诉我 我的丈夫到底发生了什么… 否则我是不会走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere until you tell me what happened to my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.09,0:30:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莫莉… - 一直以来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Molly. - All this time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.93,0:30:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我一直都在找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for him and you knew that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.43,0:30:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道的… 你们知道格雷利杀了他 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew that Greeley killed him, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.64,0:30:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.23,0:31:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.94,0:31:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.94,0:31:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.44,0:31:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.78,0:31:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.78,0:31:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带你去见他 上车吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take you to him. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.22,0:31:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在那边的房子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in that house, right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.35,0:31:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.94,0:31:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.71,0:32:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.60,0:32:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.73,0:32:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.11,0:32:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是大卫的妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's David's wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.53,0:32:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.37,0:32:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,15年前 你和你丈夫开车撞死了格雷利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen years ago, you and your husband hit Jonah Greeley with your car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.38,0:32:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫幸存了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.50,0:32:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.92,0:32:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,41号公路不止一个灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're saying that there isn't just one spirit haunting Highway 41.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.18,0:32:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.22,0:32:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷利和你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonah Greeley and you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.55,0:33:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这15年间 一年中有一个晚上 你会出现在公路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the past 15 years, one night a year you've been appearing on that highway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.85,0:33:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.31,0:33:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们的结婚纪念日… 2月22号…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was our anniversary, February 22nd…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.56,0:33:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 1992年 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 1992. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.11,0:33:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 现在已经是2007年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, it's 2007.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.91,0:33:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.41,0:33:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我说说41好公路 - 15年来有12起事故{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, tell me about Highway 41. - Twelve accidents over 15 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.37,0:33:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,5起致命 全部都发生在同一个晚上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five of them fatal. All of them happening on the same night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.46,0:33:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找的是什么… 州际死亡区？搭车鬼灵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we looking at? Interstate dead zone? Phantom hitchhiker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.29,0:33:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不完全是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.75,0:33:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 一年接一年 目击者都陈述说是同一种东西令他们发生车祸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, year after year, witnesses said the same thing made them crash:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.09,0:33:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人出现在路中间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman appearing in the middle of the road…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.09,0:33:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面是一个满身是血的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}being chased by a man covered in blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.97,0:33:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个幽灵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two spooks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.69,0:33:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉葬在哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where is Molly buried?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.65,0:33:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她… 她没被下葬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She…She wasn't buried anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.99,0:34:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被火化了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was cremated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.83,0:34:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 焚化尸骨的事就到此为止了 - 那是什么让她一直出现的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So much for burning her bones. - Yeah, but then what's keeping her here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.59,0:34:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly! Ahh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.63,0:34:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些幽灵只能看到他们想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some spirits only see what they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.64,0:34:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.39,0:34:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.47,0:34:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.31,0:34:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.32,0:34:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.15,0:34:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我想她不知道自己已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I don't think she knows she's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.53,0:34:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你了 请开门 求求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Open up, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.45,0:34:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 冷静下来 告诉我们到底发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right, just calm down. Tell us what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.54,0:34:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要告诉她什么？- 真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you gonna tell her? - The truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.33,0:34:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会被吓的朝另外的方向跑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna take off running in the other direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.46,0:34:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些幽灵被束缚的太紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some spirits hold on too tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.01,0:34:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.51,0:35:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那格雷利呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Greeley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.72,0:35:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年他都要为他的死而惩罚某人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each year he punishes somebody for his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.06,0:35:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,追赶他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, chasing them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.98,0:35:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}torturing them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.02,0:35:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And each year…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.53,0:35:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个某人就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that somebody is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.20,0:35:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我一点也不记得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't remember any of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.49,0:35:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你看不到真相 莫莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you couldn't see the truth, Molly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.83,0:35:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's why he won't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.96,0:35:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我离开那条公路的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me off the highway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.54,0:35:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.80,0:35:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撞死了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.84,0:35:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀死了他们两个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.39,0:35:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们第一次见到我的时候 为什么不告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me when you first saw me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.73,0:35:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么要等到现在？- 你不会相信我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why wait until now? - You wouldn't have believed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.57,0:36:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把我当做诱饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you needed me for bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.70,0:36:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we needed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.70,0:36:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.95,0:36:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 我们带你来这里 是想让你能向前走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, we brought you here so you could move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.79,0:36:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我得告诉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I have to tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.92,0:36:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.63,0:36:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱他？你很抱歉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you love him? That you're sorry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.09,0:36:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 这些他都知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, he already knows that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.60,0:36:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想进去 我们是不会阻止你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna go in there, we're not gonna stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.98,0:36:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会把他吓坏的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you are gonna freak him right out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.86,0:36:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.83,0:36:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫已经和你告过别了 莫莉 现在轮到你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David's already said his goodbyes, Molly. Now it's your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.46,0:36:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你未完成的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your unfinished business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.38,0:36:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.67,0:37:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.13,0:37:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}let go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.68,0:37:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了大卫 为了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of David, of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.51,0:37:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能这样做…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.97,0:37:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为你就能向前走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we think you'll move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.02,0:37:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们不知道我会去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.94,0:37:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.94,0:37:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 你不属于这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly, you don't belong here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.03,0:37:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没受够折磨吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you suffered long enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.49,0:37:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.70,0:37:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.63,0:38:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她并不是个太坏的… 鬼魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess she wasn't so bad for a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.80,0:38:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为她真的会去一个更好的地方吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she's really going to a better place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.60,0:38:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.73,0:38:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猜我们永远都不会知道的 直到我们亲身体验过后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we'll never know. Not until we take the plunge ourselves, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.15,0:38:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都不重要 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't really matter, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.86,0:38:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱有希望才是关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope is kind of the whole point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.82,0:38:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 海利乔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Haley Joel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.83,0:38:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上路吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hit the road.{\r}
